val marker is a BUTTON press, so POL-NS-12 does not apply and arrival and dwell are tested against the exported trace under POL-NS-02; the marker was not false (the driver was at the pin, within 50 m, when he tapped) and POL-NS-05 is not engaged. No POL-NS-09 escalation trigger fires: confidence is above the 0.70 floor, the artefacts agree rather than contradict, the repeat-dispute and abuse counters are zero, and no deciding fact rests on an impaired artefact. All figures are read from the brief's money block."
